    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "99D9B7F252E45E13",
      "text": "¡Ya ves!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "99D9B8F252E45FC6",
      "text": "¿Y eso?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "3C250C1F2F973FF4",
      "text": "¡Cómo me alegra no ser la única que lo piensa!\\nEntonces, ¿ya has visto todo lo que tienen aquí?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_01b",
      "hash64": "CA332EFDDE010BE2",
      "text": "¿Qué clase de pregunta es esa?\\c\\nHe estado investigando y alucino con las cosas\\nque tienen aquí.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "3C250F1F2F97450D",
      "text": "Por ejemplo, justo debajo de la academia hay\\nuna planta submarina destinada a aprovechar\\r\\nlos recursos naturales renovables...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "3C250E1F2F97435A",
      "text": "Por lo que he oído, en ella también llevan a cabo\\ninvestigaciones y estudios sobre el fondo marino.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "3C25091F2F973ADB",
      "text": "Aunque, evidentemente, a los estudiantes no se\\nles permite la entrada...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
