      "hash64": "3130DE5AA9E6DCBE",
      "text": "¡Quién sabe!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_select_04",
      "hash64": "3130E15AA9E6E1D7",
      "text": "Era el director...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "E6DB39293EA352BC",
      "text": "Tenía un aura extraña, yo creo que de verdad\\nera un ser fantástico.\\c\\n¡Voy a ponerme manos a la obra para investigar\\ntodo acerca del señor hada elegante![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_06b",
      "hash64": "E9D4FF156F85CF3A",
      "text": "¡¿Que era el director?! Ni que buscasen adrede a\\nla gente más rara para los puestos de dirección,\\r\\nporque el nuestro también tiene tela...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
